From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:16:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 534/537] [DS4.1] Decode rows for the verification lookahead

A request verifying num_verification_tokens drafts stays on the decode plan
(reorder threshold 1 + lookahead), the attention's decode capacity and the
DSpark context graphs cover max_decode_rows, the ratio-2 compressor's state
ring holds every verified row, and sequence-parallel prefill starts above
max_decode_rows. All unchanged without copy drafts.
